    {
        "text": "The information erupting from the singularity does not cease, and among the flow, there is an insignificant scene that has never been accessed since the day of its recording\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the quiet of space, a ray of light illuminates a field of stars, bringing with it darkness and a despair beyond doubt."
    },
    {
        "text": "When sensors tens of thousands of light-years away receive the image of this starfield from the distant past, the planets that these stars shed their light upon are already filled with graveyards and ruins."
    },
    {
        "text": "It has come."
    },
